@page "/about"

<div style="max-width:800px; margin:auto; margin-top:40px;">

    <h2>About Secure Budgeting</h2>

    <p style="margin-top:15px;">
        Secure Budgeting is a web-based application developed as a senior capstone project
        to help college students better manage their finances in a simple and intuitive way.
    </p>

    <hr />

    <h4>Features</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>Track income and expenses</li>
        <li>Set and manage budgets</li>
        <li>Receive alerts when nearing limits</li>
        <li>Visual dashboard for financial insights</li>
    </ul>

    <hr />

    <h4>Technologies Used</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>ASP.NET / Blazor</li>
        <li>Azure SQL Database</li>
        <li>Azure App Service (Cloud Hosting)</li>
    </ul>

    <hr />

    <h4>Security</h4>
    <p>
        The application uses secure authentication and ensures that user data is protected.
        All communication is secured and user data is isolated per account.
    </p>

    <hr />

